ize: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 74pt; text-indent: -74pt; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">▷ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">제출 대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">현재 재학생으로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2021-1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학기 성적 이수 예정자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, 2021</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">월 졸업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">수료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">예정자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">수업연한초과자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">졸업유예자 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">▷ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">외국어시험성적 적용기준 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">2020. 6. 1. ~ 2021. 5. 31.</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">까지 취득한 성적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">응시일자 기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; - (</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">외국어 성적 입력 및 성적표 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">업로드</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">2021. 06. 30.(</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">까지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">*</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">기한엄수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">*</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">우리대학 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">‘<font face=\"함초롬바탕\">BISKIT</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt;\">에 입력 및 제출되어야 함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">공인외국어시험 및 국제교류교육원에서 실시하는 모의토익</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">모의토익스피킹 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">모두 인정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">국제교류교육원에서 실시하는 모의토익</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">모의토익스피킹 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">성적은 국제교류교육원에서 일괄 등록하므로 학생이 별도로 입력 및 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 하지 않아도 됨 하지만</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">본인의 성적이 우리대학&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">‘<font face=\"함초롬바탕\">BISKIT</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">에 제대로 입력되어 있는지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">\"</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">기한 내에</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">\"  \"</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">학생본인이</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">\" “</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">반드시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">” </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">확인하</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 여야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">모의토익 성적이 제대로 반영되어 있지 않거나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">모의토익 문의는&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">어학상담실&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">478-7959,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">국제교류교육원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">478-7216</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">로 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">교내 성적장학생은 외국어성적을 취득하여야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">외국어시험성적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">토익기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">을 제출하지 않을 경우 성적장학생 선발에서 제외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 외국어시험 성적은 장학선발의 기본자격이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">자격충족자 중 우수자 선발</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※<span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">등록학기 기준으로 기준이 적용되오니 착오없으시기 바람</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ex) 1-2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학기 성적으로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2-1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학기 등록시 장학생으로 선정되기 위해서는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학년 외국어성적기준을 충족해야 함 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">승인완료 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 2021. 7. 9.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">까지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">학과 연락처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">붙임</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">▷ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">제출 방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">붙임 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">외국어성적 입력 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">’ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">참고 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">공인외국어시험점수환산표수정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(제2외국어 추가&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">반영</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">  </span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">붙임  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1. 2021-1 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">교내 성적장학생 선발관련 외국어성적표 제출 안내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">외국어성적입력방법</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt;\">공인외국어시험 점수 환산표&nbsp;</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"12598\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5216\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"User\",\n\"s